{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>לא תעבר בי</b> — Because Israel wanted to pass through the king's highway, which is the road of the towns, in order to collect toll and benefit from trade; even so, he sent to them <b>לא תעבור בי</b>, meaning: within my towns. He feared lest they conquer his towns."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:18:51.638310885Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}